			"notes": "# NoFingerprint 1.1.7.1-nofingerprint.2-beta.1\n\nFirst public beta of **NoFingerprint**.\n\nNoFingerprint is a client-side Fabric privacy mod focused on reducing unnecessary client fingerprinting and information disclosure to Minecraft servers.\n\nThis project is an independently maintained GPL-3.0 fork of **OpSec by aurickk**.\n\n## Highlights\n\n- Rebranded and independently maintained as NoFingerprint\n- Client brand spoofing\n- Channel/custom payload filtering\n- Known-pack filtering where supported\n- Translation/keybind probing protection\n- Per-account resource-pack cache isolation\n- Local/private resource-pack URL blocking\n- Explicit IPv4/IPv6 private range handling\n- CGNAT (`100.64.0.0/10`) protection\n- IPv6 ULA (`fc00::/7`) protection\n- HTTP redirect validation including 308\n- Minecraft 1.20.1 local pack URL protection\n- Improved ExploitPreventer compatibility\n- Telemetry blocking\n- Chat signing controls\n- Runtime probe/debug infrastructure\n- Expanded security and competitor audits\n\n## Supported builds\n\n- Minecraft 1.20 – 1.20.1\n- Minecraft 1.21.11\n- Minecraft 26.2\n\nThese representative builds were successfully compiled and verified at the JAR level.\n\n## Important limitations\n\nThis is a **beta release**.\n\nSome protections are still **code-verified only** and have not yet completed full live play-state testing.\n\nKnown limitations include:\n\n- `spoofAsVanilla` is disabled by default\n- allowed mod networking channels may reveal installed mods\n- DNS rebinding / DNS TOCTOU is only partially mitigated\n- Account Manager currently stores access/refresh tokens unencrypted on disk\n- 26.2 runtime probing is not currently supported by the probe harness\n- behavioral fingerprinting may still exist\n\nNoFingerprint does **not** claim to be:\n\n- undetectable\n- anti-cheat proof\n- 100% vanilla-identical\n- a complete anonymity solution\n\n## Security\n\nSee:\n\n- `SECURITY_AUDIT.md`\n- `COMPETITOR_AUDIT.md`\n- `FINGERPRINT_SURFACES.md`\n- `RUNTIME_PROBE_RESULTS.md`\n\nfor detailed implementation and testing notes.\n\n## Upstream\n\nNoFingerprint is based on:\n\n**OpSec by aurickk**\n\nOriginal project:\nhttps://github.com/aurickk/OpSec\n\nThe original GPL-3.0 license and attribution are preserved.\n\n## Checksums\n\nSHA-256 hashes for all release JARs are included in:\n\n`SHA256SUMS.txt`\n\n## Downloads\n\nChoose the JAR matching your Minecraft version from the assets below."
